window.products.push({"id":94669,"name":"OYLUS Commercial Ice Maker Machine, Stainless Steel Freestanding Ice Machine 70lbs/24H With 10LBS Ice Storage Capacity, 32 Ice Cubes Within One Cycle ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E9eJzL4mL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【High Efficient Ice Making】- OYLUS Commercial ice maker has a powerful and efficient compressors, it make up to 70 pounds of ice in 24 hours and quickly makes 32 pieces of high quality ice within one cycle of 11-20 mins. The 17 LBS of ice bin for ice storing provides you with plenty of ice. Easy to use, high ice making efficiency, large ice storage capacity, allowing you to fully enjoy your party. 🧊【Two water inlet methods】- There are two ways to supply water to the ice maker machine , one is to connect the water inlet pipe to the faucet (we provide complete accessories). The other is when you are in a room without a faucet or outdoors, You can use bottled water, place it, start the ice maker, wait for a while, the ice cubes will come out. What a convenient design! 🧊【Multiple Functions】- You can easily set different ice cube sizes and 3 thicknesses of ice cubes (S-M-L) according to your needs. The automatic protection function effectively prevents danger from occurring. When the ice maker machine is short of water or full of ice, the machine will stop making ice, and the indicator light on the control panel will light up to remind you to operate. 🧊【High-quality Material】- The ice machine body is made of stainless steel, durable and beautiful, Ideal for home, office, restaurant, bar and Cafe. The thickened foam layer in the interlayer of the fuselage will effectively reduce the melting speed of ice in the ice bin. The 32-piece ice tray uses pure copper-nickel ice trays, it safe and corrosion-resistant. You can always get fresh and healthy ice cubes with OYLUS ice maker. 🧊【Full Set Of Accessories】- OYLUS commercial ice machine has a full set of accessories, including an ice scoop, a 5 ft. long water supply hose with faucet connector, and a 3.12ft long drain hose. We are committed to providing customers with the best shopping experience and high-quality products. Before first use, clean the ice machine and keep it upright for 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E9eJzL4mL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYLUS","source_asin":"B092S4GXQB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-94669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092S4GXQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092S4GXQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
