window.products.push({"id":94723,"name":"Countertop Ice Machine, Portable Ice Cube Makers Machine 26LBS/24H, 9 Bullet Ice Cubes Ready in 7 Mins, Intelligent Alarm System, with Ice Scoop and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X4bnWTNFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍻KEEP ICE IN HAND: Popular bullet ice cube with small or large size of ice cube, the ice maker machine allows you to choose your size of ice cube on the control panel. The smart ice maker not only can meet your all kinds of needs for ice cubes: iced food, smoothies, beverages, emergency use, etc. , but also does not make too much noise during ice-making. 🍸QUICK AND EFFICIENT ICE-MAKING: ARLIME ice maker countertop is equipped with a highly efficient compressor, it only takes 7 minutes to make 9 bullet-shaped ice cubes. Keep the 2 quart water tank filled and this ice machine will produce 26 pounds of ice in a 24 hour period, which is enough to keep drinks cold all day long and can meet the demands for ice cubes of a family each day. It is enough to keep drinks cold all day long. 🥤SMART FUNCTIONS FOR USE: Small ice maker has the most advanced infrared sensor technology and simple operating panel, which helps you to run this ice maker conveniently. When the ice basket is full, home ice maker will stop the ice making to prevent ice from overflowing and to remind you of take ice out. When it is lack of water, the red indicator light will remind you to replenish water in time. 🍹COMPACT DESIGN FOR COUNTERTOP: The tabletop ice maker is small enough to fit on most countertop. And it also features a transparent viewing window to check on ice making progress. Removable ice basket and ice scoop provides more convenience to move ice cubes. Perfect for any countertop, including Kitchen, Living room, Bedroom, Office, Party, RV or Poolside, and when you're entertaining and hosting parties both indoors and outdoors. 🍾EASY TO CLEAN: Made of food-grade material, ARLIME ice cube maker is just for your health and safety, no odor. Durable ABS shell, smooth and easy to clean. Removing the ice basket, opening the drain plug and drying the water tank. Then using a soft cloth, along with some warm water and vinegar, wipe the water tank. ARLIME offers 1-year for this safe and portable ice maker machine. If you hava any question with ice machine, please ask us for help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X4bnWTNFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARLIME","source_asin":"B08YJVQJ2T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-94723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJVQJ2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJVQJ2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
